{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ffd0e240907779b78c34c050a00d1654faf734811502eddb321cd310b42d2d13", "ja": "（コラボは順調、志希も劇場の公演に出てくれる\n事になった！　今日もこれからステージだ……）", "zh": "（合作进行得很顺利，志希也答应来剧场公演了！今天接下来也要登台演出……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1001_205xxx", "source_sha256": "49a18ae9f8b2f2970819a51c758691e6e8f1e8b84bc06ef0fbb79bddec532cd2", "ja": "あー、いたいた～！\nちょっとキミ。志希ちゃん、ヒマ～。", "zh": "啊～找到了找到了～！\n我说你呀，志希现在好～无聊哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ef61958376b6c09115e3d3848b4be28a280cbb40009e3ebc76a3acf40a6b0576", "ja": "えっ。もうすぐステージなのに？\nそして衣装も着てるのに？", "zh": "咦。明明马上就要上台了？\n而且明明都已经换好服装了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1003_205xxx", "source_sha256": "f573757c06801e83842b0769763216eaf507dfae2d52755f2e2c50311ac93721", "ja": "そーそー、もうすぐステージ。それは楽しみ～♪\nだからこそヒマなんだよね。", "zh": "对对，马上就要上台了。真让人期待～♪\n正因为这样才觉得闲嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1004_205xxx", "source_sha256": "d46259c69086b62781746059c42bdadc973c8975676c499ad45b0c9568bf09bc", "ja": "楽しいコトを待たされてる時間って、\nおかしくなっちゃう気がしない？", "zh": "等待开心的事情时，\n是不是会觉得自己都快要疯掉了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1005_205xxx", "source_sha256": "61cf853d62c2eece793864cd204d03bc99406dce1e941ec4e40e79a7eb02a5a4", "ja": "あー、もームリ、我慢できなーい！\nというワケで～……レッツ失踪☆　キミもどう？", "zh": "啊——已经不行了，忍不住啦——！\n所以说～……来搞个失踪吧☆　你要不要也一起？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7a4e88abff30cdc8c56c5fe9ef0fcef9b98e9f72832756eb23b653192b98fc41", "ja": "いやいやいや！　どう？も何も、それは困るよ！\nさすがに今からじゃ、どうフォローすれば……！", "zh": "不不不！问我“要不要”也没用啊，这可不行！都已经到现在了，我该怎么帮你善后啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1007_205xxx", "source_sha256": "1950a75c62496c86403f27876ea25cd371291bab2fb8795239b284e64b592e65", "ja": "にゃは♪　いい反応するねー、キミ！\nうんうん。半分ジョーダンだから安心して♪", "zh": "喵哈♪　你的反应不错嘛——！\n嗯嗯。因为有一半是在开玩笑，所以放心吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d47c3216099ea660458cae02f2c686f0fd0f53944a08fa688b2f6f713df4468d", "ja": "半分は本気なのか……。\nうん、まあでも、安心はしたかな。", "zh": "一半是认真的吗……\n嗯，不过嘛，确实是放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1009_205xxx", "source_sha256": "4ec0dd9bc622867240dff3c3a838960142312d04dc02e3a8bc4a9db3a75661e4", "ja": "えー？　それはツマンナーイ。\nもっと刺激が必要かなー。", "zh": "诶——？那样就没意思啦。\n看来还需要更多刺激才行呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7c1aae793c90db377a3862adf12fbf6046bae14878f6c14942e3de210a667387", "ja": "もう十分刺激的だよ。失踪する理由が、アイドルがイヤ\nとか飽きたとかじゃないみたいだから安心しただけで。", "zh": "已经够刺激了。我只是因为你失踪的理由\n并不是讨厌偶像或者厌烦了，才放下心来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e02373fbd39f6f502f13c3c7680a83b2240d6c2e4f4ceb0b8a000e941f7ac057", "ja": "それなら、まあいいかなと……。\nいや、よくないけど！", "zh": "那样的话，嗯……也就算了吧。\n不，才不能算了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1012_205xxx", "source_sha256": "4e509e321c48ec87e808e9a4d6f6434afbb9befd63f3c3b99be9374b2eb536a8", "ja": "ホントだよね～。\n志希ちゃん、自分でもビックリ！", "zh": "真的耶～  \n连志希自己都吓了一跳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1013_205xxx", "source_sha256": "7273da1df24edd0fdc00c19ccaa5986ae6834f7af554cb071be2f82491788e19", "ja": "もしかしたら、すぐに飽きちゃうかも～って\n思ってたんだよね。でも、キョーミはまだ続いてる！", "zh": "我还想着，说不定很快就会腻了呢～不过，我的兴趣还在持续！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d9b3810ca912eb0ce7c46baf191c98817655042e50200e09a627fa0a0e187d5c", "ja": "そっか。それは、それだけいい環境に恵まれたって\n事なんじゃないかな。……仲間も含めて。", "zh": "这样啊。那说明你遇到了这么好的环境吧……当然也包括伙伴们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1015_205xxx", "source_sha256": "40cd753c267ad2148202c578cc70dffc70fac5fb74ebd33629c3a85bf285bece", "ja": "ふふーん、そうかもね〜。ウチの事務所、飽きないし。\nそ、れ、に……ふふっ♪", "zh": "哼哼～，也许吧～。我们事务所怎么都待不腻。\n而、且……嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1016_205xxx", "source_sha256": "e012c6309a7e83091e69b3de059a05464c32d6e860ce75c6723a23ec430c0767", "ja": "あ、そろそろ時間？　ヒマつぶし大成功～♪\nんじゃ、ステージへ行ってこよっかな。", "zh": "啊，差不多到时间了？打发时间大成功～♪\n那我去舞台上逛逛吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_205xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_205xxx0013_1017_205xxx", "source_sha256": "f96e0fd2db4b25e69373bd5dd59bf434f16aec2c19b6d1237e475d7dd719e612", "ja": "しっかり見てないと、どっか行っちゃうかもよ～？\nなーんてね♪", "zh": "不好好看着的话，说不定会跑到什么地方去哦～？\n开玩笑的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
